# [HTTPBIS](../wg/httpbis.html)

## Summary

The HTTP Working Group (HTTPBIS) met to review progress on active working group drafts and discuss several new proposals. The working group agreed to issue a second Working Group Last Call (WGLC) for [draft-ietf-httpbis-resumable-upload](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-resumable-upload/) and a WGLC for [draft-ietf-httpbis-pre-denied](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-pre-denied/). Updates and open issues were addressed for [draft-ietf-httpbis-secondary-server-certs](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-secondary-server-certs/). Additional proposals discussed included HTTP signature keys, the `Redirect-By` header, updates to HTTP Status 402 (Payment Required), parallel appends for resumable uploads, authenticating HTTP tunnels with message signatures, and unbound DATA frames for HTTP/3.

